{"reviewId": "584105440_853DMXjuJ", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "康波的衰退阶段不是“慢慢衰退”，而是通过一次大规模危机突然转折。\n这些危机之所以重要，是因为它们：\n\t1.\t摧毁旧秩序（货币体系、金融体系、产业体系）\n\t2.\t清算过度投资与过度杠杆\n\t3.\t迫使全球进入“低增长、低利率、债务高企、消费降级”的长时期衰退\n\t4.\t直到新技术出现（如AI、电动车、清洁能源）带来新的繁荣前夕\n", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "5204-5286", "abstract": "一般来讲，衰退阶段首先会出现一个标志性的经济危机，比如第四次康波的1971—1973年布雷顿森林体系崩溃，2008年美国的次贷危机，事实上都确认了康波进入衰退阶段。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "584105440_853DMXjuJ", "userVid": 584105440, "topics": [], "createTime": 1764535771, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 584105440, "name": "大姐姐（信息没回再找我一下）", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEIzXFOQyumeU27libMhPRFBrCgJSxKysnygVkUeksibMK39ianxOvNS6tfH26I7Lia9OGIS7VCPsgAIy9tMa7O5QMOq09s0gy7eQuZVJIicBB4zA6g/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 15, "likes": [{"userVid": 388469992, "name": "小羊咩咩🐑", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0017-sVlk638G6s0iKzxf2qI92d2/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "小羊咩咩🐑", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-5", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作研习生", "levelIndex": 5}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "比如疫情", "reviewId": "